[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12120.55, "timestamp": "03:22:00", "text": "あなたがここで見るものはすべて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12123.91, "timestamp": "03:22:03", "text": "すべてを伝えて、送信します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12127.389, "timestamp": "03:22:07", "text": "ファイルとして保存され、ストリーマーがこれを読みます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12130.309, "timestamp": "03:22:10", "text": "ファイルを作成してYouTubeチャットに送信し、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12132.349, "timestamp": "03:22:12", "text": "Twitchチャット"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12134.79, "timestamp": "03:22:14", "text": "正気だから、ジョックが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12137.269, "timestamp": "03:22:17", "text": "休憩中、現在視聴中なので"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12139.75, "timestamp": "03:22:19", "text": "そして、YouTube の動画リンクは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12143.03, "timestamp": "03:22:23", "text": "だから、それをやり直す必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12145.83, "timestamp": "03:22:25", "text": "寝具フレーム関連のものですよね？では、私たちが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12149.11, "timestamp": "03:22:29", "text": "まず、私ができることは、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12152.59, "timestamp": "03:22:32", "text": "えっと、私が何をするか分かるでしょ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12156.07, "timestamp": "03:22:36", "text": "コピー版を実行してみましょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12157.229, "timestamp": "03:22:37", "text": "の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12158.83, "timestamp": "03:22:38", "text": "これ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12163.51, "timestamp": "03:22:43", "text": "えーと、テスト、テスト、テスト、えーと、テスト"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12165.51, "timestamp": "03:22:45", "text": "当然の権利"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12168.389, "timestamp": "03:22:48", "text": "ええと、こちらで対応します。気にしないで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12170.75, "timestamp": "03:22:50", "text": "その他のボタン。それらは古いものです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12173.59, "timestamp": "03:22:53", "text": "もの。そうそう。パニックで頭がぼやけた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12175.75, "timestamp": "03:22:55", "text": "さて、私はこれを使わないでしょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12178.67, "timestamp": "0